{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚（28日）TVB節目《璀璨之城》上演激烈婆媳大戰！劇中飾演奶奶的江美儀與新抱張曦雯關係徹底引爆，江美儀更句句無面畀，火藥味極濃。劇中兩人更發生激烈推撞，夾在中間的吳卓羲左右為難，場面極度繃緊，究竟這段婆媳關係會如何收科？\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀發惡還拖 寸爆張曦雯冇鬼用</h2>\n<p>劇情講述，Kate（張曦雯飾）因無法理解奶奶丁麗明（江美儀飾）為何要丈夫孝君（吳卓羲飾）放棄所有權力，加上感到被丈夫冷待，終於忍不住大爆發，更將矛頭直指奶奶：「點解要遲啲（知），你有咩唔可以同我講，我要依家知呀」、「係咪奶奶要你咁做呀？」丁麗明聽到後即時發惡還拖，毫不留情鬧爆新抱：「點解點解？咪因為你冇鬼用囉」、「你咁想走，你走囉，冇人攔你呀，走呀！」說畢二人更發生激烈推撞，丁麗明乘勝追擊：「你真係大膽呀！我叫你行你企喺度，依家你咩態度呀？」、「你咁唔鍾意呀！冇辦法㗎喎，除非你唔做我新抱啫，如果唔係我日日都話畀你聽咩叫規矩。」</p>\n<h2>張曦雯委屈爆喊 眼神戲獲讚大進步</h2>\n<p>雖然在婆媳大戰中處於下風，但張曦雯（Kelly）的演技亦備受網民關注。在被吳卓羲勸回家向奶奶道歉一幕中，Kelly不但演活了角色道歉時的百般扭擰與無奈，當她面對奶奶的不客氣及不領情時，那種委屈再瞬間轉為怒睥丈夫的眼神戲更被讚是一絕，細膩的表情轉換讓觀眾完全代入到Kate的困境與無助之中，大讚她演技一套比一套好。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚江美儀 封追劇MVP力推二封視后</h2>\n<p>江美儀在連串場口中展現出神級層次演技，對著看不順眼的新抱時而霸氣、時而藐視、時而威嚴，精湛演出連日來獲得網民洗版式讚好，更封她為追看《璀璨之城》的MVP，並力推她憑此角色二封視后！網民紛紛留言：「變面速度情緒轉變太快，氣場不是一般的大」、「口才一流，懟人厲害」、「演技好好，值得二封視后」、「美儀姐令我追到停唔到」、「睥新抱眼神好凌厲」、「官家嘅飯真係好難食」、「江美儀咩髮型都 Carry到」、「不愧視后」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_1296367696ae2dc7385d55.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_1296367696ae2dc7385d55.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_11365574166ae2dc769becb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_11365574166ae2dc769becb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6959262326ae2dc594d11d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6959262326ae2dc594d11d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_18408419366ae2dc5c9ffc1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_18408419366ae2dc5c9ffc1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_7562696046ae2dc5fd4a59.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_7562696046ae2dc5fd4a59.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17775759716ae2dc6288555.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17775759716ae2dc6288555.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_6992349906ae2dc65db368.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_6992349906ae2dc65db368.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_4549902026ae2dc6971a41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_4549902026ae2dc6971a41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_12366284296ae2dc6cb45ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nor