uploads/2026/10/21_19957447066ae2dc824d931.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_3145152626ae2dc853be38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_3145152626ae2dc853be38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_534846286ae2dc87dab82.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_534846286ae2dc87dab82.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_13884125466ae2dc8a916d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_13884125466ae2dc8a916d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_16005187626ae2dc8d6b8f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_16005187626ae2dc8d6b8f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_2290592916ae2dc90318b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_2290592916ae2dc90318b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_18289730726ae2dc930f10c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_18289730726ae2dc930f10c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:01.407418+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1233,"images":20,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:30:08+00:00","fetched_at